 "briefing": "# Razorpay Briefing: Changes from 16 October to 15 November 2026\n\n## Summary\n\nNo verified changes at Razorpay can be reported for the 30-day window. Every search attempt failed with a \"Rate limit exceeded\" error, so no news, product launches, executive hires, or deals were retrieved, dated, or linked to a source. Nothing in this briefing should be read as evidence that any event did or did not happen in the window. The gaps below should be closed before the meeting on 17 November 2026.\n\n## News and Press Coverage\n\n- **Status:** Nothing verified.\n- No items from the Razorpay newsroom, press page, or blog were retrieved.\n- No coverage from Economic Times, Mint, Moneycontrol, Inc42, Entrackr, YourStory, Reuters, Bloomberg, or TechCrunch was retrieved.\n- No regulatory developments, legal matters, leadership commentary, or IPO speculation were identified.\n- **Where to check:** The official newsroom and blog at [Razorpay](https://razorpay.com) are the primary sources to review first.\n\n## Product Launches and Feature Releases\n\n- **Status:** Nothing verified.\n- No launch or feature announcement was confirmed for any product line in the window. This covers the payment gateway, Payroll, Capital and lending, POS, banking, Route, Subscriptions, Smart Collect, and any AI or agentic commerce offering.\n- No changelog, product blog, or release note was reached.\n- **Where to check:** The product and blog sections of [Razorpay](https://razorpay.com), followed by the product coverage in [Inc42](https://inc42.com) and [Entrackr](https://entrackr.com).\n\n## Executive and Key Hires\n\n- **Status:** Nothing verified.\n- No appointments, departures, or promotions were found for the CEO, co-founders, CFO, CTO, CPO, board, or country or VP-level roles.\n- No LinkedIn posts or profiles were accessed. Per the brief, LinkedIn is the preferred primary source for hires.\n- **Where to check:** The leadership page at [Razorpay](https://razorpay.com), LinkedIn posts from the co-founders, and the company's LinkedIn page. Business media such as [Economic Times](https://economictimes.indiatimes.com) and [Moneycontrol](https://www.moneycontrol.com) should be searched for \"appoints,\" \"joins,\" or \"steps down.\"\n\n## Deals: Funding, Acquisitions, Partnerships, and Customer Wins\n\n- **Status:** Nothing verified.\n- No funding rounds, secondary sales or tender offers, acquisitions, partnerships, bank or card network tie-ups, customer wins, or regulatory approvals were identified.\n- No subsidiaries, affiliates, or investee companies were identified.\n- **Where to check:** Funding and deal reporting in [Entrackr](https://entrackr.com) and [Inc42](https://inc42.com), RBI press releases at [Reserve Bank of India](https://www.rbi.org.in), and Ministry of Corporate Affairs filings at [MCA](https://www.mca.gov.in).\n\n## Dates and Flags\n\n- No items were found, so none could be checked against the 16 October to 15 November 2026 window.\n- No items are flagged as unverifiable, because no candidate items were identified.\n\n## Open Questions for the Meeting\n\n1. Which product launches, feature releases, or partnerships has Razorpay announced since 16 October 2026, and which of these are live for merchants now? Razorpay's newsroom and blog at [Razorpay](https://razorpay.com) are the starting point for confirming this.\n2. Have there been any changes to the senior leadership team or the board in the last 30 days, and are any further hires planned for the product, finance, or regional roles? Public statements on this are best checked through LinkedIn and the [Razorpay](https://razorpay.com) leadership page.\n3. Are there any funding, secondary share sale, acquisition, or regulatory milestones in progress that Razorpay can speak to, such as updates to RBI licences or approvals? Current reporting should be checked at [Reserve Bank of India](https://www.rbi.org.in) and in [Entrackr](https://entrackr.com).\n\n## Sources\n\n[1] Razorpay: https://razorpay.com\n[2] Inc42: https://inc42.com\n[3] Entrackr: https://entrackr.com\n[4] Economic Times: https://economictimes.indiatimes.com\n[5] Moneycontrol: https://www.moneycontrol.com\n[6] Reserve Bank of India: https://www.rbi.org.in\n[7] Ministry of Corporate Affairs: https://www.mca.gov.in",
